# MODEL-G-043: Ports b, A10, A2, VDD, vdd, VDD and non-port c; port renumber (Q-MODEL-9, Q-MODEL-10).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/mt -noprompt
snap internal
load a
box 1 1 1 1
label b
port make
box 3 1 3 1
label A10
port make
box 5 1 5 1
label A2
port make
box 7 1 7 1
label VDD
port make
box 9 1 9 1
label vdd
port make
box 11 1 11 1
label VDD
port make
box 20 1 20 1
label c
port renumber
save a
